Subject: [PATCH 37/52] Guide: View Games (820/821-2/828, Gamerscore info)

The gamer card's View Games (9010C6E8) opens 820_GameShowcaseMe ("All
Games"): the titles played (MeGameList) with icon, name, "%1 of %2
Achievements" and gamerscore earned, or noGamesText. Y goes to
GamerscoreMoreInfo.xur (the hidden yButton's PressPath). A opens
821-2_GameAchievStatsMe for the title (AchievementsList). A row shows the
name or "Secret", "Unlocked <date>" / "Unlocked" / "Locked", the
gamerscore or "--", and the picture or unearnedAchievement.png. The header
is the title, with sortOrderText and "%1 of %2 unlocked". Y re-sorts by date
(9010EDA8) or by gamerscore (9010EE10), keeping the focus. A opens
828_AchievDetails (90104B28). Both lists scroll a row at a time with their
scroll ends.

